```

So the fix involves adding a sentinel object to prevent recursive calls during module initialization, then using Object.assign to populate it with the actual loaded module. This prevents the infinite recursion by ensuring the module is already in the cache when it's being loaded. I need to find the right version of the facade-runtime.ts file from the fix commit to apply this change properly.

